This snapshot has no upstream Git commit metadata. File hashes are supplied
for reproducibility; it is not described as an official tagged release.
The runtime includes no experiment datasets, credentials, or example projects.

The public launchers add relative paths, isolated outputs, installation,
download verification and environment checks. They do not change the stored
network architectures, loss functions, numerical solvers, or model weights.
